---
source: crates/biome_formatter_test/src/snapshot_builder.rs
info: attributes/class-style.html
---

# Input

```html
<p
  class="
    foo
    bar
    baz
  "
></p>

<div class="  foo   bar	baz  "></div>
<div class='  foo   "bar"   baz  '></div>
<div class=""></div>

<div
  style="
    color:red;
    font-size:10px;
  "
></div>

<div style='font-family: "Rotis Sans";color:red'></div>
<div style="font-family: &quot;Rotis Sans&quot;;color:red"></div>
<div style="content: 'a; b';color:red"></div>
<div style='content:"a";/* "quoted" */color:red'></div>

```


# Formatted

```html
<p class="foo bar baz"></p>

<div class="foo bar baz"></div>
<div class='foo "bar" baz'></div>
<div class=""></div>

<div style="color: red; font-size: 10px;"></div>

<div style="font-family: 'Rotis Sans'; color: red;"></div>
<div style="font-family: 'Rotis Sans'; color: red;"></div>
<div style="content: 'a; b'; color: red;"></div>
<div style="content: 'a'; /* &quot;quoted&quot; */ color: red;"></div>

```
